From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gezim <gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Kompakt: a swipe anywhere on the picker pages, and Shortcuts has no previews

The page swipe (0006) was caught by the options scroll view only, so a swipe
on the previews did nothing. The detector now lives on the picker's motion
layout (PagedMotionLayout) and sees every touch first; the scroll view only
pages. An open option page (the sheet) does not page.

The Shortcuts page showed the lock and home previews although Home has no
shortcuts. An opaque cover, drawn over the previews and under the sheet, hides
them on that page only (the previews are not touched, so they redraw as they
did). It is set in the secondary constraint set, so leaving the page restores
the primary state.

---
diff --git a/res/layout/fragment_customization_picker2.xml b/res/layout/fragment_customization_picker2.xml
index af1b2b0..bb5500c 100755
--- a/res/layout/fragment_customization_picker2.xml
